+{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0187QSpe8P4ph8StGRvivhBk","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have read all the files in the repository. Let me compile the complete information into a comprehensive report.\n\n## Complete SSG Toolkit Codebase Exploration Report\n\nI've thoroughly reviewed the entire SSG toolkit codebase. Here's the complete content organized by category:\n\n### **CONFIGURATION FILES**\n\n#### `/workspace/package.json`\n- Project: `bench-ssg-toolkit` v1.0.0\n- Type: ES Module\n- Main entry: `dist/core/index.js`\n- Scripts: `build` (tsc), `lint` (eslint), `test` (vitest)\n- Dev dependencies: TypeScript 5.9.3, Vitest 2.1.9, ESLint, TypeScript ESLint\n- Runtime dependencies: Express 5.2.1, Marked 17.0.2, their TypeScript types\n\n#### `/workspace/tsconfig.json`\n- Strict mode enabled\n- Target: ES2022, Module: Node16\n- Output: `./dist`, Root: `./src`\n- Declaration files enabled\n- ESM interop and skip lib check enabled\n\n#### `/workspace/.eslintrc.cjs`\n- Parser: @typescript-eslint/parser\n- Recommends: eslint:recommended + plugin:@typescript-eslint/recommended\n- Custom rule: unused variables allowed with `_` prefix\n- Environment: Node + ES2022\n\n#### `/workspace/vitest.config.ts`\n- Globals enabled\n- Test timeout: 10 seconds\n\n---\n\n### **CORE SOURCE FILES**\n\n#### `/workspace/src/core/types.ts` - Type Definitions\n```typescript\ninterface SiteConfig {\n  title: string;\n  baseUrl: string;\n  outputDir: string;\n  contentDir: string;\n  templateDir: string;\n}\n\ninterface ContentFile {\n  slug: string;\n  title: string;\n  content: string;        // raw markdown or html\n  metadata: Record<string, unknown>;\n  date?: string;\n  tags?: string[];\n  template?: string;\n}\n\ninterface BuildContext {\n  config: SiteConfig;\n  files: ContentFile[];\n  output: Map<string, string>;      // output path -> rendered content\n  assets: Map<string, Buffer>;      // output path ->